      <h1>The Battle Over Standards and the Battle Over Gateways: Education AI&#x27;s Two Fronts Open at Once in September 2026</h1>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>2026-09-12</span>
        {tags.filter(Boolean).map(t => <span class="tag">{t}</span>)}
